<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Oil to skip topper turnarounds in 1997.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Oil to skip topper turnarounds in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiyo Oil Co Ltd said on Friday it does not plan to shut its crude distillation units for maintenance checks in 1997.</p>
<p>Taiyo Oil runs two toppers at its Kikuma refinery in western Japan, with a total crude processing capacity of 89,000 barrels per day.</p>
</text>
